not merely in receiving the first demonstration event. Test duplicate and delayed delivery cases before depending on the integration for unattended decisions."]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"deep-dive","className":"article-prose deep-dive","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Treat the notification as a delivery system"}],[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["A webhook tells your system that an event was sent; it does not automatically guarantee that the event will arrive once, in order, or at a convenient time. Design the receiver around the provider's documented delivery contract. Verify authenticity using the supported mechanism, reject malformed payloads, and acknowledge only after the event has been safely accepted for processing. Keep the public endpoint narrow. It should not turn arbitrary event text into an instruction for an agent with publishing or spending permissions."]}]]}]],["$","figure",null,{"className":"editorial-diagram diagram-flow","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mono acid","children":"THE IDEA, UNPACKED"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Receive, record, reconcile"}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"diagram-items","children":[["$","li","Verify",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Verify"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Authenticate the delivery through the provider contract."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Persist",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Persist"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Keep the event identifier and processing state."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Apply",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Apply"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Update the operation safely, including duplicates."}],false]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"diagram-caption","children":"Editorial model: a way to reason about the process, not measured platform results."}]]}],[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["Deduplicate with stable event identifiers where available and make handlers safe to repeat. If two events arrive out of order, use the underlying resource state or documented sequence information to reconcile them instead of letting the last network arrival blindly win. Record processing failures and provide a replay path with bounded retries. Avoid storing more payload data than the operation needs. A webhook integration earns its keep when an operator can answer which event arrived, what it changed and how to recover if that change did not complete."]}]]}]]}]]]}],false,false,"$L1a","$undefined","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}],"$L1f"]}]
